{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達機械人工程師達雷爾·戴（Darrell Dai）在行政總裁黃仁勳離職後辭職，如今黃仁勳重返CEO職位，戴表示自己「可能行動得太快了」，並願意考慮重返英偉達，前提是公司願意重新接納他。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587876.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:44:25.378003+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:28:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_hash":"60be0480c05c90b986ce7d982bfa7611ba19350bd46611a0c796360122372e95","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}